  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 60af0432a3c869e48a591344a8dafd71, type: 3}
  m_Name: DiscCare 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: "During an infusion visit, you mention that even though your husband\u2019s
    scans look stable, he is so fatigued from the current treatment that he can no
    longer cook or drive, making it hard for him to keep up with work and family
    life.\n\n<b>Caregivers can help research teams understand how cancer and current
    treatments affect everyday life.</b>\r\n\r\nIs this <b>true</b> or <b>false</b>?"
  explanation: "Caregivers can share personal experiences that highlight real-world
    challenges. These insights help researchers design studies that focus on treatments
    that will fit more smoothly into patients\u2019 lives. By learning about the
    daily struggles and successes families face, researchers can better understand
    what makes treatments hard\u2014or helpful\u2014in everyday life. This kind of
    input ensures early research keeps real people, not just lab results, at the
    center of discovery."
  correctAnswer: True
  incorrectAnswer1: False
  incorrectAnswer2: 
  incorrectAnswer3: 
  questionRole: Caregiver
  questionType: TrueFalse
  questionStage: Discovery
